msgstr "The muses have been kind this day."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
