msgstr "I fear we've unleashed a great evil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
