msgid "A Mysterious Past"
msgstr "A Mysterious Past"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.woodie.4.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.woodie.4.desc"
msgid ""
"As the power of the moon has grown, so too have the effects of Woodie's "
"curse. Woodie soon found that his form would shift into not only the "
"Werebeaver, but a Weremoose and Weregoose as well. As his changing forms "
"became more unpredictable, Woodie resolved to find a way to have more "
"control over his curse. Using every bit of knowledge he'd gained from his "
"time in the Constant (and some additional tips from Ms. Wickerbottom) he "
"soon discovered that his transformations could in fact be controlled. By "
"fashioning representations of each of the three beasts and consuming them "
"only when he wanted to invoke that form, Woodie now feels more comfortable "
"in his own skin than he has in quite a while."
msgstr ""
"As the power of the moon has grown, so too have the effects of Woodie's "
"curse. Woodie soon found that his form would shift into not only the "
"Werebeaver, but a Weremoose and Weregoose as well. As his changing forms "
"became more unpredictable, Woodie resolved to find a way to have more "
"control over his curse. Using every bit of knowledge he'd gained from his "
"time in the Constant (and some additional tips from Ms. Wickerbottom) he "
"soon discovered that his transformations could in fact be controlled. By "
"fashioning representations of each of the three beasts and consuming them "
"only when he wanted to invoke that form, Woodie now feels more comfortable "
"in his own skin than he has in quite a while."

