msgctxt "STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.FLOWERS.MED.1"
msgid ""
"I love the flowers you've planted, dearie. A few more would be wonderful."
msgstr ""
"I love the flowers you've planted, dearie. A few more would be wonderful."

