"We're just about there! Would you help me clean up a bit more junk, dearie?"

#. STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.JUNK.MED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.JUNK.MED.1"
msgid ""
"My place is still cluttered with some junk. Could you please help me clean "
"up?"
msgstr ""
"My place is still cluttered with some junk. Could you please help me clean "
"up?"

#. STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.JUNK.MED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.JUNK.MED.2"
msgid ""
"My dearie, I would be so grateful for your help in clearing some junk around"
" here."
msgstr ""
"My dearie, I would be so grateful for your help in clearing some junk around"
" here."

#. STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.LIGHT_POSTS.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.HERMITCRAB_DECOR_COMPLAIN.LIGHT_POSTS.LOW.1"
