#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH2"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Alpha circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Nurse Spider\n"
"\n"
"Requires 2 sockets and increases Maximum Health by 100 points.\n"
"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to provide 5% armor."
