"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to have a 50% modifier to negative sanity auras.\n"
"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to increase the sanity gain of clothing items by 30%."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY1
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY1"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Alpha circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Butterfly, or Moon Moth.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 1 socket and raises Maximum Sanity +40.\n"
"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to have a 80% modifier to negative sanity auras.\n"
"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to increase the sanity gain of clothing items by 10%."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Alpha circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Butterfly, or Moon Moth.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 1 socket and raises Maximum Sanity +40.\n"
"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to have a 80% modifier to negative sanity auras.\n"
"\n"
"Alpha Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to increase the sanity gain of clothing items by 10%."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Rabbit.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 6 sockets and raises movement speed by 25%.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to reduce slowness effects by 25%."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Rabbit.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 6 sockets and raises movement speed by 25%.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to reduce slowness effects by 25%."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED2"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Rook, or the Ancient Guardian.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 2 sockets.\n"
"The first raises movement speed by 25%.\n"
"The second raises movement speed by 15%.\n"
"The third raises movement speed by 10%.\n"
"The maximum speed boost can be 50%.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to reduce slowness effects by 25%."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Rook, or the Ancient Guardian.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 2 sockets.\n"
"The first raises movement speed by 25%.\n"
"The second raises movement speed by 15%.\n"
"The third raises movement speed by 10%.\n"
"The maximum speed boost can be 50%.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to reduce slowness effects by 25%."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MUSIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_MUSIC"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from Crabby Hermit, or the Crab King.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 3 sockets, raises Sanity of nearby survivors 5 points a minute and raises garden plant happiness from the music.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to recruit Pig Men and Bunny Men who hear the song."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from Crabby Hermit, or the Crab King.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 3 sockets, raises Sanity of nearby survivors 5 points a minute and raises garden plant happiness from the music.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to recruit Pig Men and Bunny Men who hear the song."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_NIGHTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_NIGHTVISION"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Moleworm.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 4 sockets and lets the user see in the dark. Turns on at night and when entering the Caves.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to not have mole vision any longer."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Moleworm.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 4 sockets and lets the user see in the dark. Turns on at night and when entering the Caves.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to not have mole vision any longer."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_RADAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_RADAR"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Crow, Redbird, Snowbird, Puffin or Canary.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 1 socket and increases WX-78's Vision Range.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to increase the range of the Roto-Mapper, Zaptrocuter, Bio Scanalyzer scan area, and W.A.R.B.I.S. target locking."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Crow, Redbird, Snowbird, Puffin or Canary.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 1 socket and increases WX-78's Vision Range.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering I boosts this circuit to increase the range of the Roto-Mapper, Zaptrocuter, Bio Scanalyzer scan area, and W.A.R.B.I.S. target locking."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_SCREECH
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_SCREECH"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Gamma circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Naked Mole Bat.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 3 sockets and allows WX-78 to perform a sonic attack, inducing panic on nearby creatures, and going off cooldown for 20 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"Gamma Circuits Tinkering I allows WX-78 to hold the sonic attack."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Gamma circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Naked Mole Bat.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 3 sockets and allows WX-78 to perform a sonic attack, inducing panic on nearby creatures, and going off cooldown for 20 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"Gamma Circuits Tinkering I allows WX-78 to hold the sonic attack."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_SHIELDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_SHIELDING"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Gamma circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Rock Lobster, Slurtle, or Snurtle.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 4 sockets and allows WX-78 to perform a block, providing 80% armor, going off cooldown for 20 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"Gamma Circuits Tinkering II provides WX-78 with knockback immunity in the block."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Gamma circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Rock Lobster, Slurtle, or Snurtle.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 4 sockets and allows WX-78 to perform a block, providing 80% armor, going off cooldown for 20 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"Gamma Circuits Tinkering II provides WX-78 with knockback immunity in the block."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_SPIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_SPIN"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Gamma circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Mosling.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 3 sockets and allows WX-78 to perform a spin when using any Axe or Pickaxe when working or attacking.\n"
"\n"
"Gamma Circuits Tinkering II makes WX-78 spin faster."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Gamma circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Mosling.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 3 sockets and allows WX-78 to perform a spin when using any Axe or Pickaxe when working or attacking.\n"
"\n"
"Gamma Circuits Tinkering II makes WX-78 spin faster."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from Krampus.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 1 socket and places a infinite stack-size 1 slot container in WX-78's right-most inventory slot."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from Krampus.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 1 socket and places a infinite stack-size 1 slot container in WX-78's right-most inventory slot."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_TASER
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78MODULE_TASER"
msgid ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Volt Goat.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 2 sockets and deals 20 electrical damage to WX-78's attackers.\n"
"\n"
"This module also makes WX-78 immune to electrical shock.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to allow WX-78 to get overloaded when being hit, culminating in a 50 electrical damage AoE blast when hit enough times."
msgstr ""
"Plugs into WX-78's Beta circuit board. Crafting recipe is scanned from a Volt Goat.\n"
"\n"
"Requires 2 sockets and deals 20 electrical damage to WX-78's attackers.\n"
"\n"
"This module also makes WX-78 immune to electrical shock.\n"
"\n"
"Beta Circuits Tinkering II boosts this circuit to allow WX-78 to get overloaded when being hit, culminating in a 50 electrical damage AoE blast when hit enough times."

#. STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78SCANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.SCRAPBOOK.SPECIALINFO.WX78SCANNER"
msgid ""
"Chirps when interesting biological targets are nearby.\n"
"\n"
"Will chase and scan interesting biological targets while WX-78 is close.\n"
"\n"
"Drops Bio Data when finished.\n"
"\n"
"WX-78 gave this drone the name of Jimmy."
