"Ya may not feel young, but I've been tradin' longer than ya been around, "
"young pup."
msgstr ""
"Ya may not feel young, but I've been tradin' longer than ya been around, "
"young pup."

#. STRINGS.UI.TRADESCREEN.SKIN_COLLECTOR_SPEECH.IDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.TRADESCREEN.SKIN_COLLECTOR_SPEECH.IDLE.2"
msgid ""
"I've always been a loner, me. Tha boss mostly lets me alone, which suits me "
"fine."
msgstr ""
"I've always been a loner, me. Tha boss mostly lets me alone, which suits me "
"fine."

