"Ya got a heap 'o items? Want better items? Well, ya come to tha right place!"
" Put 'em in that thar machine!"
msgstr ""
"Ya got a heap 'o items? Want better items? Well, ya come to tha right place!"
" Put 'em in that thar machine!"

