#. STRINGS.UI.XB1_USER_DIALOG.USER_2_HAS_TO_REJOIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.XB1_USER_DIALOG.USER_2_HAS_TO_REJOIN"
msgid "Player 2 will need to join the game again."
msgstr "Player 2 will need to join the game again."

#. STRINGS.UI.XB1_USER_DIALOG.USER_2_MUST_BE_DIFFERENT
